{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-18","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：不可公度量与可公度量与平行四边形","englishTitle":"If there be two unequal straight lines, and to the greater there be applied a parallelogram equal to the fourth part of the square on the less and deficient by a square figure, and if it divide it into parts which are incommensurable, the square on the greater will be greater than the square on the less by the square on a straight line incommensurable with the greater.","book":10,"number":18,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.18","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.18/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":18,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-18@raw-a99b64bf5c6b2fd0","contentId":"euclid-10-18","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a99b64bf5c6b2fd09b562bc4b73a46e26057fcdbb33cdf6e440920e6fac57cd2","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-18.statement","euclid-10-18.proof.1","euclid-10-18.construction.1","euclid-10-18.proof.2","euclid-10-18.proof.3","euclid-10-18.proof.4","euclid-10-18.proof.5","euclid-10-18.proof.6","euclid-10-18.proof.7","euclid-10-18.proof.8","euclid-10-18.proof.9","euclid-10-18.proof.10","euclid-10-18.proof.11","euclid-10-18.proof.12","euclid-10-18.proof.13","euclid-10-18.proof.14","euclid-10-18.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-18.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-18","revisionId":"euclid-10-18@raw-a99b64bf5c6b2fd0","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2535d5e1e10aa0107b522105b4b6b6cec2abebf9869d53a57d1a6385c76df0e1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If there be two unequal straight lines, and to the greater there be applied a parallelogram equal to the fourth part of the square on the less and deficient by a square figure, and if it divide it into parts which are incommensurable, the square on the greater will be greater than the square on the less by the square on a straight line incommensurable with the greater."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果有两种不平等的直线,如果数量较大,则对较小的数量适用平行四边形等于正方形第4部分,并有正方形个缺陷,如果将其分成不可公度个部分,则较大数量的正方形个部分将大于正方形个小部分,再加正方形个小部分,再加不可公度个大部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-18.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-18","revisionId":"euclid-10-18@raw-a99b64bf5c6b2fd0","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aa7c9b0053a0ba2dda676fc985db6853950e52c7358c5896784c27c3ea5e713c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, if the square on the greater be greater than the square on the less by the square on a straight line incommensurable with the greater, and if there be applied to the greater a parallelogram equal to the fourth part of the square on the less and deficient by a square figure, it divides it into parts which are incommensurable."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果较大数量上的正方形比小数量上的正方形大于正方形, 以不可公度线上的正方形为基准,且数量较大,如果对较大数量应用平行四边形等于数量较小的正方形中的第四部分,并有正方形的缺陷,则分为不可公度部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-18.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-18","revisionId":"euclid-10-18@raw-a99b64bf5c6b2fd0","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"22decb81e8161d5d0df4228ee23d00b6818622881ca0a8ca948a4b8e58f59b49","citations":["euclid-10-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, BC be two unequal straight lines, of which BC is the greater, and to BC let there be applied a parallelogram equal to the fourth part of the square on the less, A, and deficient by a square figure. Let this be the rectangle BD, DC, [cf. [Lemma before X. 17](/principles/euclid-10-16)] and let BD be incommensurable in length with DC; I say that the square on BC is greater than the square on A by the square on a straight line incommensurable with BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,BC是两个不平等的直线,其中BC是较大数量,如果对小数量A和不足正方形的正方形适用平行四边形等于第四部分,则适用不可公度和433。让矩形,BD,DC, DC, BD长于DC;我说,BC的正方形比A的正方形大,在正方形直线上比不可公度和BC长于正方形。 [cf. [引理 before X. 17](/principles/euclid-10-16)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-18.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-18","revisionId":"euclid-10-18@raw-a99b64bf5c6b2fd0","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e9bbb7acc4d893083e5fe697c9e4763924db6a404f7c0b3a8a6fa23d1d3b30d2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, with the same construction as before, we can prove similarly that the square on BC is greater than the square on A by the square on FD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,用与以前相同的建筑,我们同样可以证明,BC比正方形比A比正方形比FD比正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-18.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-18","revisionId":"euclid-10-18@raw-a99b64bf5c6b2fd0","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b255207f1d0bc309c187ef36c4b617e11e806c3477ddaccc0dc1c2598cb356e1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is to be proved that BC is incommensurable in length with DF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"需要证明的是,BC长度为不可公度,DF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-18.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-18","revisionId":"euclid-10-18@raw-a99b64bf5c6b2fd0","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"703bc409a23ccbed47a2d29db8caa46b48aaa3f3f35f15bd53295768a1ba1014","citations":["euclid-10-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since BD is incommensurable in length with DC, therefore BC is also incommensurable in length with CD. [[X. 16](/principles/euclid-10-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于BD长不可公度,DC长,因此BC长不可公度,CD长。 [[X. 16](/principles/euclid-10-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-18.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-18","revisionId":"euclid-10-18@raw-a99b64bf5c6b2fd0","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9026ab80a7ff71059f18487d711a5fe52f7ec7625207b59af38b52fa778b2093","citations":["euclid-10-6","euclid-10-13","euclid-10-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But DC is commensurable with the sum of BF, DC; [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)] therefore BC is also incommensurable with the sum of BF, DC; [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)] so that BC is also incommensurable in length with the remainder FD. [[X. 16](/principles/euclid-10-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DC是可公度,总和为BF,DC;因此,BC也是不可公度,总和为BF,DC;因此,BC也是不可公度,其余的FD。 [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)] [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)] [[X. 16](/principles/euclid-10-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-18.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-18","revisionId":"euclid-10-18@raw-a99b64bf5c6b2fd0","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"631ad25ef89591b99d8e6ef4971f62a2c664e9b28ab29e5e7b67e05ea57fba01","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the square on BC is greater than the square on A by the square on FD; therefore the square on BC is greater than the square on A by the square on a straight line incommensurable with BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BC的正方形比A的正方形还要多,FD的正方形比FD的正方形还要多,因此,BC的正方形比A的正方形,不可公度和BC线上的正方形都大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-18.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-18","revisionId":"euclid-10-18@raw-a99b64bf5c6b2fd0","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2fbdaf3560e8eb7742f0edf107d2c015b132834c41e666a0d526e22b5c14c570","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, let the square on BC be greater than the square on A by the square on a straight line incommensurable with BC, and let there be applied to BC a parallelogram equal to the fourth part of the square on A and deficient by a square figure. Let this be the rectangle BD, DC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BC的正方形比A的正方形长,不可公度直线比BC直线比正方形高,A直线比不可公度直线高,BC平行四边形直线等于正方形第四半,但有正方形数字的缺陷。（相关点与线段：BD、DC）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-18.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-18","revisionId":"euclid-10-18@raw-a99b64bf5c6b2fd0","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"474194e346d96f1b65af4d06c599c4231f7232fe8112153bdd951089f4260cc9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is to be proved that BD is incommensurable in length with DC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"需要证明的是,BD长度为不可公度,DC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-18.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-18","revisionId":"euclid-10-18@raw-a99b64bf5c6b2fd0","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"41328601f7d240826d60362d5851d3d35982441b385a04b42026bd5a17d4d25e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, with the same construction, we can prove similarly that the square on BC is greater than the square on A by the square on FD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样的建筑,我们可以证明,BC比正方形比A比正方形比FD比正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-18.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-18","revisionId":"euclid-10-18@raw-a99b64bf5c6b2fd0","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a610e91efe11c7524d23f0e1bb989004043a2bee6c511e7a803a3f9684ca35c8","citations":["euclid-10-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on BC is greater than the square on A by the square on a straight line incommensurable with BC; therefore BC is incommensurable in length with FD. so that BC is also incommensurable with the remainder, the sum of BF, DC. [[X. 16](/principles/euclid-10-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BC的正方形比A的正方形长,不可公度直线比BC直线的正方形高;因此,BC长不可公度,FD,BC,不可公度,其余的BF,DC。 [[X. 16](/principles/euclid-10-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-18.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-18","revisionId":"euclid-10-18@raw-a99b64bf5c6b2fd0","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"489c3b2b2754555987313eab8d62c544e021e425b83b02de1619409dc18b1a2f","citations":["euclid-10-6","euclid-10-13","euclid-10-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the sum of BF, DC is commensurable in length with DC; [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)] therefore BC is also incommensurable in length with DC, [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)] so that, separando, BD is also incommensurable in length with DC. [[X. 16](/principles/euclid-10-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BF,DC是长度可公度和DC;因此,BC也是不可公度,DC因此,塞帕兰多,BD 也是不可公度 长度为DC。 [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)] [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)] [[X. 16](/principles/euclid-10-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-18.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-18","revisionId":"euclid-10-18@raw-a99b64bf5c6b2fd0","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-18.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-18","revisionId":"euclid-10-18@raw-a99b64bf5c6b2fd0","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6928e30c33509799a52fac5e2becf49e8d98e360adcddb316ddc6d00557fa2b4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"[Lemma. Since it has been proved that straight lines commensurable in length are always commensurable in square also, while those commensurable in square are not always commensurable in length also, but can of course be either commensurable or incommensurable in length, it is manifest that, if any straight line be commensurable in length with a given rational straight line, it is called rational and commensurable with the other not only in length but in square also, since straight lines commensurable in length are always commensurable in square also."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"[引理. 由于已经证明长度可公度线正方形的直线总是可公度,正方形的可公度线并不总是长度可公度,当然也可能可公度或不可公度长,如果某一有理线段的任何直线是长度可公度,那么显然,它不仅在长度上,而且在长度上也称为可公度,因为长度可公度线正方形的直线也总是可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-18.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-18","revisionId":"euclid-10-18@raw-a99b64bf5c6b2fd0","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0c543046079a5c1f60a23684df15d05d5b25b30b6b832330b1ada4747ae47203","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if any straight line be commensurable in square with a given rational straight line, then, if it is also commensurable in length with it, it is called in this case also rational and commensurable with it both in length and in square; but, if again any straight line, being commensurable in square with a given rational straight line, be incommensurable in length with it, it is called in this case also rational but commensurable in square only.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果正方形的任何直线为可公度,加上给定的有理线段,那么,如果与该直线同时为长度可公度,则本案中也同时为有理和可公度,长度为正方形;如果与给定的有理线段,直线为可公度,长度为不可公度,则本案中也为有理,长度为平方可公度而长度不可公度。 ]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-18.source","contentId":"euclid-10-18","revisionId":"euclid-10-18@raw-a99b64bf5c6b2fd0","order":16,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8f2b4c72a75c923453536b97a0330c41fda23b925a15e1fce5ae03259d66a9e7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.18/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.18\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-18:euclid-10-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-18","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-18.construction.1","euclid-10-18.proof.4","euclid-10-18.proof.5","euclid-10-18.proof.10","euclid-10-18.proof.11"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_